	(text "V5-V6 Change Summary\n\n- Add RC filter to output monitor op-amp to smooth output\n- Add glue logic to control fan power: now only running if charging or keyswitch on\n\nNote: Back of board must be bonded to heat sink.  Use thermal interface like TGF20-07870787-039.  \n"
